   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key Expertise Areas &amp; Cross-cutting Areas (NL MoFA NLRC Partnership)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme encompasses projects funded under the NL MoFA&#x2013;NLRC Partnership (2022&#x2013;2026) for Key Expertise &amp; Cross-Cutting Areas with a total budget of EUR 2.160.999 (net).

See the specific areas as follows:
*The Key Expertise Areas: Data &amp; Digital, Financial Sustainability (FS) and Water/ Water Sanitation &amp; Hygiene (WASH).
*The Cross-Cutting Areas: Community Engagement &amp; Accountability (CEA), Green Response, Mental Health &amp; Psychosocial Support (MHPSS), and Protection, Gender &amp; Inclusion (PGI).</narrative>
  </description>
